Bind EGLImage textures as external textures.

An EGLImage texture was bound to GL_TEXTURE_2D, which works for RGBA images only. Hardware video decoders hand out YUV frames (on Sailfish OS, gst-droid's Android graphics buffers), and GPUs sample those only through GL_TEXTURE_EXTERNAL_OES and samplerExternalOES. The texture is now bound and reported to the engine as GL_TEXTURE_EXTERNAL_OES, which takes any EGLImage, RGBA ones included, so the plugin API doesn't change.

Skia samples external textures already. Impeller needs engine patch 0004-embedder-external-oes-impeller (patches/<ver>/engine/), which wraps them as Impeller external textures, as Android does.

